Syntax: GEOIP ADD BADCOUNTRY <CC> <Reason>
        GEOIP ADD BADASN <ASN> <Reason>
        GEOIP DEL BADCOUNTRY <CC>
        GEOIP DEL BADASN <ASN>
        GEOIP LIST

Allows operators to block connections from specific countries (using
2-letter ISO codes) or Autonomous Systems (ASNs).

Examples:
    /msg OperServ GEOIP ADD BADCOUNTRY RU Spam is not allowed
    /msg OperServ GEOIP ADD BADASN 12345 Malicious ISP
